    "items": [
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "To the chief Musician, A Psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Deliver me, O LORD, from the evil man:",
          "Preserve me from the violent man;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Which imagine mischiefs in their heart;",
          "Continually are they gathered together for war."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They have sharpened their tongues like a serpent;",
          "Adders' poison is under their lips."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Keep me, O LORD, from the hands of the wicked;",
          "Preserve me from the violent man; Who have purposed to overthrow my goings."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The proud have hid a snare for me, and cords; They have spread a net by the wayside;",
          "They have set gins for me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I said unto the LORD, Thou art my God:",
          "Hear the voice of my supplications, O LORD."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "O GOD the Lord, the strength of my salvation,",
          "Thou hast covered my head in the day of battle."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Grant not, O LORD, the desires of the wicked:",
          "Further not his wicked device; lest they exalt themselves."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "As for the head of those that compass me about,",
          "Let the mischief of their own lips cover them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let burning coals fall upon them:",
          "Let them be cast into the fire; Into deep pits, that they rise not up again."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let not an evil speaker be established in the earth:",
          "Evil shall hunt the violent man to overthrow him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I know that the LORD will maintain the cause of the afflicted,",
          "And the right of the poor."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Surely the righteous shall give thanks unto thy name:",
          "The upright shall dwell in thy presence."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
